PIPE
----

* Scope :- Used for communication between processes that have a parent-child relationship. 

* Creation :- Created using pipe() system call.

* Naming :- No name is associated with the pipe, so it is only available for the processes that create it (usually related processes).

* Lifetime :- Exists only as long as the processes are running.

* Usage :- Commonly used to transfer data between processes in a one-way or unidirectional manner.


